  <Properties>
    <blockList>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "b31d69d8-05f2-4ef9-b985-37e112e00966",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:3cef1485-a35c-4985-9b46-a4846ff7817a}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022What is stoolball?\u0022\u003EWhat is stoolball?\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStoolball is a team sport which has been played for over 500 years. Similar to cricket, two teams compete to score the most runs. It is played by ladies-only teams, mixed teams and schools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:3441f1ba-e7ca-4274-a486-80e98867c683}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Starter stoolball\u0022\u003EQuick start stoolball\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe 10 simplified rules you need to play fun quick start stoolball. Perfect for trying out the sport in the park or leading a school PE lesson. Always use a soft ball.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:945afab1-9b4c-4d0f-933f-6c8b477c4900}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Rules of stoolball\u0022\u003ERules of stoolball\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe rules for stoolball are easy to learn: similar to but simpler than the laws of cricket. These are the updated rules for 2018\u20132020. You should read about the spirit of stoolball too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:537d3266-7602-47c1-945c-fcbb4fb00489}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Spirit of stoolball\u0022\u003ESpirit of stoolball\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStoolball is a sport that owes much of its unique appeal to the fact that it should be played not only within its rules but also within the spirit of the game. Any action which is seen to abuse this spirit causes injury to the sport itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:06dada04-aaa6-4315-b443-527b942af551}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Code of conduct and players\u0027 responsibilities\u0022\u003ECode of conduct and players\u0027 responsibilities\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the the excitement of a match it is sometimes difficult for players, club officials and parents to take an objective and balanced view about any match their team is involved in. Whether you\u0027re watching or playing, please keep this code of conduct in mind.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:d252d70c-eb31-4bf2-ba92-d4b7deed01b2}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Indoor stoolball\u0022\u003EIndoor stoolball\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStoolball is played all year round, moving indoors for the winter. With its softer ball, indoor stoolball is particularly good for children.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:21d0cf6d-8534-4a7f-b4a4-3d3fe99064af}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022How to score a stoolball match\u0022\u003EHow to score a stoolball match\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA step-by-step guide to what to put where in a stoolball scorebook, even when something unusual happens. Print it out and have it beside you when you score.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\u0022after\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:f2389cac-c554-48b7-ae0c-31998db0f830}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Stoolball equipment and gifts\u0022\u003EEquipment\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGet everything you need to play stoolball, including bats, balls and wickets, and find out how to care for your equipment.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:fac037fe-db36-4379-82ae-26ac0e79b55c}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Coaching stoolball\u0022\u003ECoaching\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether you\u2019re a complete beginner, keen to improve, or you want to teach others to play stoolball, we can help.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
